NAME
     rapportd – Rapport Daemon.

SYNOPSIS
     Daemon that enables Phone Call Handoff and other communication features
     between Apple devices.

     Use '/usr/libexec/rapportd -V' to get the version.

LOCATION
     /usr/libexec/rapportd

